        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 6d50c5e3-251f-4c65-8b1e-18a4bdc7c62d).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.  Our client has tracked down the most ruthless yakuza members responsible for his entire family&apos;s demise. They are within the Gama Facility&apos;s private security detail. The two-faced yakuza lawyer, Yuki Yamazaki, assisted them in becoming &quot;not guilty&quot; on all charges. Because of this, they will all be attending a celebration in the Gama staff break room. They are currently waiting for the facility&apos;s helicopter pilot to deliver the pizza for their party. I&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
